      "message": "depending on how often you write the config vs how often you handle scan results (and thereby the blacklist).  Please consider that you can also turn a hashset into an arraylist pretty trivially:\nList\u003cString\u003e list \u003d new ArrayList\u003cString\u003e(hashset);",
