        "id": 1086611
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-03-03T01:43:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To be honest, this chunk of code is copied from WNS which was copied from the original QNS. I think on the enable side, we are relying on the fact that mBasidBlacklist.remove() will return null if input bssid is null. On the disable side, we don\u0027t want to add an element for null bssid. So the check is here.",
      "parentUuid": "bbfbc447_b6e4c0f8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1026,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 1026,
        "endChar": 31
      },
      "revId": "af1ee09663c9a19ead56c08b84bfa9257cf80d40",
