      "writtenOn": "2017-03-03T01:43:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For SoCs that don\u0027t support firmware roaming, it can happen that firmware tries to connect to an AP which is blacklisted at the framework level. Also supplicant might do something on its own.",
      "parentUuid": "14503260_890e0c48",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1034,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 1034,
        "endChar": 40
